<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-2e1ff860-7482-435a-a81a-456b63c6a11a@mhtml.blink" /><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-18f112c1-9cb1-44e2-aaac-597664ee00c1@mhtml.blink" /><link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="cid:css-02eaa2c4-3d08-4362-8b67-de7f6ecaa6ec@mhtml.blink" /><title>BlogNest API.docx</title><link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://ssl.gstatic.com/docs/documents/images/docs-favicon-2026-v2.ico"><meta property="og:title" content="BlogNest API.docx"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Google Docs"><meta property="og:url" content="https://docs.google.com/document/u/0/d/1QJdDREX8NJgGtsD0gU-2qavYthOGFR4t/mobilebasic?usp=embed_facebook"><meta property="og:image" content="https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/docs/AHkbwyI-e6-S1b3XC5_rS2JiiNoyQ6c_V3h9HmbK6KGXm1WvrTGq7uYl7z5HIvZaF70ObXFMYwdMYcEmh03c47keg5LhsYDtHX-Gw_wD=w1200-h630-p"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:description" content="ContentGen - Generate high-quality blog content using AI Description The ContentGen backend is a powerful, secure, and intelligent REST API platform designed to simplify blog creation, content management, and AI-assisted writing. Built with Node.js and Express.js, the application uses MongoDB as ..."><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,minimum-scale=1,user-scalable=0"><meta name="referrer" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></head><body jsaction="u0pjoe:.CLIENT"><div id="docs-ml-header-id" class="docs-ml-header"><span class="docs-ml-header-item docs-ml-header-drive-link"><div id="docs-ml-header-drive-link-aria-label" style="display:none;">Go to Drive</div><a href="https://drive.google.com/u/0?usp=docs_web" aria-labelledby="docs-ml-header-drive-link-aria-label" role="button"><div class="docs-ml-header-icon-container"><div class="docs-ml-icon docs-ml-header-icon docs-ml-arrow-back-dir"><div class="docs-ml-img-container docs-ml-img docs-ml-arrow-back-icon"></div></div></div></a></span><span class="docs-ml-header-item docs-ml-header-document-title"><div class="docs-ml-header-document-title-text">BlogNest API.docx</div></span></div><div class="app-container"><div class="doc-container"><div class="doc"><div class="doc-content" style="background-color:#ffffff;max-width:468pt;padding:72pt 72pt 72pt 72pt"><div><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p></div><h1 id="h.iizc2ec0rwxd" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:20pt;padding-bottom:6pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">ContentGen - Generate high-quality blog content using AI</span></h1><h2 id="h.ej0ff3i03lq7" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:17pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Description</span></h2><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">The </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">ContentGen</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;backend is a powerful, secure, and intelligent REST API platform designed to simplify blog creation, content management, and AI-assisted writing. Built with </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Node.js</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;and </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Express.js</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">, the application uses </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">MongoDB</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;as its primary database with </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Mongoose ODM</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;for efficient data modeling, validation, and seamless database interactions.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">The platform integrates </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Google Gemini AI</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;to provide intelligent features such as </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">AI-powered blog content generation</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">AI FAQ assistance</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">AI WeatherWise insights</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">, and </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">AI FitTrack recommendations</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">, enabling users to create high-quality, context-aware content with minimal effort.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Security is a core aspect of the architecture, implementing </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">JWT (JSON Web Tokens)</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;for stateless authentication, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">role-based access control (Admin, Editor, Author, Reader)</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;for authorization, and </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">bcrypt.js</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;for secure password hashing. The backend also supports comprehensive blog management, categories and tags, comment management, media metadata handling, advanced search capabilities, and centralized error handling. Additional security mechanisms such as request validation, input sanitization, rate limiting, and structured logging ensure the platform remains reliable, scalable, and resilient against common web vulnerabilities.</span></p><p style="padding-top:12pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Designed with a modular and scalable architecture, </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">ContentGen</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;serves as a modern AI-powered Content Management System (CMS) that combines traditional blogging capabilities with Generative AI to deliver a smarter, faster, and more personalized content creation experience.</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.krcexqb1i6ca" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Scenario-Based Case Study </span></h2><h3 id="h.rqnvot8hx6hp" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Background</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Priya is a content creator who manages multiple blogs but struggles to organize posts, schedule publications, manage categories/tags, and track reader engagement efficiently.</span></p><h3 id="h.f8n4vp8ltbqf" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Problem</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_12-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Difficulty managing multiple drafts, categories, and tags.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Limited visibility into post performance and engagement analytics.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Time-consuming processes for content approval and comment moderation.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">No streamlined system for handling media uploads or metadata.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Lack of collaborative permission tiers for editors, authors, and administrators.</span></li></ul><h3 id="h.2qw3rcbhfiuw" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Solution</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">The BlogNest backend delivers a centralized, secure API wrapper that decouples application business logic from frontend delivery systems. It introduces an internal permission matrix controlling specialized services for content scheduling, category taxonomy, media path registration, and granular user roles.</span></p><h3 id="h.4sha3mytz3aa" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Usage</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_6-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Author Usage:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Creates blog posts, uploads media pathways, organizes content drafts, and reviews their distinct post-performance data.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Editor/Admin Usage:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Accesses protected endpoints to review content queues, change publishing statuses, moderate visitor comments, and orchestrate user privilege upgrades.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Reader Usage:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Queries public list routes to consume posts and invokes comment creation endpoints.</span></li></ul><h3 id="h.h24qn2tp8q9" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Outcome</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">By offloading workflow controls to a robust backend, content execution delays are minimized. Data structural integrity is strictly maintained through schema validation, security filters guarantee that only authorized roles perform administrative shifts, and persistent tracking provides raw analytics to measure post optimization metrics accurately.</span></p><h3 id="h.1rsliur3uwdk" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">1. Software Requirements</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_8-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Operating System:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Windows 10/11, macOS, or Linux (supports cross-platform operations).</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Node.js (v16 or above):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Runtime ecosystem running server logic and routing infrastructure.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">npm (v8 or above):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Node package manager to control operational dependencies.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Express.js:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Lightweight routing web framework to construct backend RESTful entry points.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">MongoDB:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Document NoSQL engine storing users, posts, categories, comments, and analytics metrics.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Postman:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;API verification toolkit to assert schema validation responses across administrative route shields.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Code Editor:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Visual Studio Code or similar IDE environment.</span></li></ul><h3 id="h.wlmerbwa5bpw" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">2. Hardware Requirements</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_5-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Processor:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Intel Core i5 (8th Gen or above) / AMD Ryzen 5 or equivalent.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">RAM:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;8 GB minimum (16 GB recommended for concurrent instances of MongoDB, processing layers, and execution nodes).</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Storage:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;1 GB of available disk workspace.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:18pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Epic:-1 PROJECT ARCHITECTURE <br><br></span><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 624.00px; height: 332.00px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztbNDF7HGqJprLAsI1l9EK3pCiG2EvyjKVEM0L1AzhW5Tt1_e21GHm7CT10M4Aje6am3M56engSW4v0HqyHztPdFYJsAzcHBxLSF3glofqHj8ylm_aAKjK2yr_KBzEb7FtMM81NCMHzmRnDs-QfLNi5h10PlkEK4Xw=s320" style="width: 624.00px; height: 332.00px; margin-left: 0.00px; margin-top: 0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;"><br></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">The BlogNest application exposes structured endpoints handled by a layered server architecture model. Incoming requests undergo filter processing before interacting with data services.</span></p><h3 id="h.ul5p1qrl93iz" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Components Definition</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_1-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Interface:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;API tools like Postman query distinct route paths to extract JSON entities.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Express Server Gateway:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Monitors network ports, maps explicit HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE), parses JSON payloads, and handles CORS headers.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Authentication &amp; Role Matrix Middleware:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Extracts tokens from headers, validates user context signatures, and evaluates if the specific role satisfies authorization thresholds for guarded resource paths.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Granular Services (Logic Modules):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Enforces isolated domain rules for blog lifecycles (Draft, Pending Approval, Scheduled, Published), comment queues, and system reporting indicators.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Database Interface Layer:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Mongoose translates operational application logic into performant native MongoDB queries.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">AI Flow (Service Integration):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Provides intelligent content automation, including automated blog post generation and real-time content summarization. This layer connects to external AI models via specialized endpoints (/api/ai/generate-blog and /api/ai/summarize), allowing the controller layer to offload complex text processing tasks and enhance content creation workflows.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">BlogGenerator with AI:</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp;A specialized service that automates the generation of blog content, which integrates with the AI Flow service to streamline the drafting process.</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.e8tzzzqeqhul" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:16pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></h2><h2 id="h.mturg09ymwqr" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Entity-Relationship (ER) Diagram Description</span></h2><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">The underlying document structure manages several collections bound by logical application references:<br></span><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 624.00px; height: 443.21px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztZ_3dqvCP4TbL8byMJnWnHmQPVZUZLFj2VRGjRQu9ilX-lma5uF8yyySSK-uHjhO6d3aMZXDWQhpAQRnCqDcLkevccbzERLgXDrdkHG4Z30y5Nxwc9DpUyhjQ3DBrAnw8W6ziW5HylhoJi8nUuR7MuRC-9P1rq-sw=s320" style="width: 624.00px; height: 443.21px; margin-left: -0.00px; margin-top: -0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"><br><br></span></p><h3 id="h.tcx6v7en4i3p" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">1. User Entity</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_10-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">_id</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(Primary Key - ObjectId)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">name</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String, Required)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">email</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String, Required, Unique)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">password</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String, Hashed, Required)</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">role</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String, Default: "reader")</span></li></ul><h3 id="h.gr37jq38icfx" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">2. Post Entity</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_11-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">_id</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(Primary Key - ObjectId)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">userID</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(Foreign Key referencing User Collection)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">name</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String, Required - represents Title)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">photo</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(Object/String pathway link)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">message</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(String - Core content body)</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">likes</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(Number, Default: 0)</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">timestamps</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;(True)</span></li></ul><h3 id="h.kxoxw77dhn8v" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Key Structural Mappings</span></h3><ul class="lst-kix_list_7-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">User to Post (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;An author can submit multiple blog documents.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">User to Comment (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Readers/Users can append multiple response comments across independent post nodes.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Post to Comment (One-to-Many):</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;A single blog document stores individual referenced comment submissions.</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.pe9wc4uex8qk" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Key Features</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_list_4-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Role-Based Route Guarding:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Strict token processing blocks unauthorized tiers from modifying core settings.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">CRUD Blog Execution Engine:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Complete schema management over content definitions, status states, and asset assignment paths.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Categorization System:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Native tag indices facilitate filtering and querying for enhanced discoverability.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Comment Moderation Logic</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">: Protected entry points for updating moderation flags (approved, pending, spam).</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Sanitization Safeguards: Payload parameter sanitation prevents XSS vectors and NoSQL parameter manipulation injections.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">I-Driven Blog Generation Pipeline: </span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Integrates external Large Language Model (LLM) abstractions and context-aware prompt templates to synthesize full-length, structured blog posts from high-level thematic inputs.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Intelligent Content Summarization Engine:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Leverages semantic compression layers to parse extensive article payloads, dynamically generating concise abstracts and automated metadata summaries.</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.gotlr02z8n90" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:16pt;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></h2><h2 id="h.dwe2ffaxz7iq" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Roles and Responsibilities</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_list_3-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Admin:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Complete environment override control. Can manage user database registrations, alter role assignments, prune malicious comments, and inspect full logging entries.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Editor:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Focuses on editorial workflows. Reviews pending draft posts, marks records for instant publication, and handles category cleanup scripts.</span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Author:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Restricted account access. Can issue creation statements only for posts bound to their explicit account record.</span></li><li style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Reader:</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;Consumer access profile. Reads published materials and posts comments under an ongoing authenticated identity.</span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-size:15pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">User Flow:</span><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;"><br></span><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 624.00px; height: 510.26px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztb4izdnUY8nFtorTCBCPn-N3wqrFP2StKf2OzVjbzBCvosysZOQg8rwP118hU3ToyCvMAyFNDNRaGUOa3cHg6EFqFShx29Al8AS5LerXx_Ek4WFhSBiOkgTFauQgpwAxE6g6-G9k3AWowhhoBu8mCMPZ3EdKos=s320" style="width: 624.00px; height: 510.26px; margin-left: 0.00px; margin-top: 0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"><br></span></p><h2 id="h.u14w07swx1it" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">MVC Architecture Pattern</span></h2><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">The system architecture structures its source configuration layers around the Model-View-Controller design pattern to completely decouple components: <br><br></span><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 601.70px; height: 338.67px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztaMgWNmdlxktMmE6Wd4PTzcTJnBn-Os4n4d5xDvzNUhSHGkkSg26uwCaFwBfSDhQz2_-BoaqSjEAQGGfECdH0nj0nzGx3swP0i8IDIPZYPOqAzFIX1zZAsogkhpjGchwPmQN5gJcSvwbcv-827-tEovB9XZ4zSqvQ=s320" style="width: 601.70px; height: 338.67px; margin-left: 0.00px; margin-top: 0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span></p><h3 id="h.fsvnqvye6z9f" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Model Layer (Data Blueprint)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Defines structure blueprints via strongly enforced Mongoose schemas mapping explicit fields into raw collection items inside MongoDB. It sets default states, indexing rules, and transformation parameters before validation persistence occurs.</span></p><h3 id="h.itzhkdvtc0x8" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Controller Layer (Execution Matrix)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">The intermediary brain of the ecosystem. It captures request vectors from the execution routes, checks structural request constraints, delegates processing workflows directly to models, and packages the resultant output into standard JSON return arrays.</span></p><h3 id="h.jipsfnif2b6f" style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#434343;padding-left:0;font-size:14pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">View Layer (Routing Network Interface)</span></h3><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">In this pure headless backend service context, standard user-interface template views do not exist. Instead, the interface layer lives as an API </span><span style="font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Routing Layer</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">. It links network requests on specified paths directly to their associated controller handler logic maps.</span></p><h2 style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;page-break-after:avoid;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:18pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">Epic2: Project Setup and Configuration<br><br></span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Creating project folder</span></h2><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">1. &nbsp;Create a new folder with your &lt;project name&gt;.</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">2. &nbsp;Inside that folder create one new folders.</span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">3. &nbsp;Name another one as Server.<br><br>4. &nbsp;Now open that folder in VS Code. &nbsp;<br></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; margin: 0.00px 0.00px; border: 0.00px solid #000000; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); width: 445.00px; height: 558.91px;"><img alt="" src="https://docs.google.com/u/0/docs-images-rt/ALKuztYVWnO-yYzbqhuCUDkDJkP4MNPf5c73owmaUVFquQ4BgmIpAq8zIR_5v_KDmPVuhC3xnI2djsmv1a2X5wVnw2oftFpDhLwwkjVU4agNvhiOEHKad0aRskOSZIiB6Do_WscSoggjbccDsY8twjXrJYt-TzzNdaw=s320" style="width: 445.00px; height: 558.91px; margin-left: 0.00px; margin-top: 0.00px; transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px); -webkit-transform: rotate(0.00rad) translateZ(0px);" title=""></span><span style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;"><br><br><br></span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Server setup (npm init)</span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_9-1 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Open Server folder in terminal of VScode.</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_list_9-2 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:108pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">npm init -y</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_list_9-1" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Create files:</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_list_9-2 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:108pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">server.js</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_list_9-1" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:norm