</p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:16pt;font-weight:700;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">1. </span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Configure MongoDB: </span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:15pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_2-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Install Mongoose.</span></li></ul><p style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">In your Node.js project directory, run:</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.1500000000000001;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="font-size:13pt;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">npm install mongoose</span></p><ul class="lst-kix_list_2-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Create database connection. </span></li><li style="padding:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.1500000000000001;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:13pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Create Schemas &amp; Models. </span></li></ul><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;line-height:1.0791666666666666;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0791666666666666;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:justify;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:16pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;;font-style:normal">Create Database connection: </span></p><p style="padding-top:0pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:8pt;font